              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "naples34102"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not my \"cup of tea\"as I'm not a fan of these type coffee drinks, but Hubs enjoyed it for a weekend treat - both making it (he does love that espresso machine and frother thingy) and drinking it. I have to say it was pretty!",
